'''Gang of Killers''' (暗殺者コンビ, ''Ansatsusha Konbi'', '''Assassin Partners''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

